<p>The deeper correction underneath all three: the 11th house describes the <em>how</em> of connection, not the <em>who</em> or the <em>whether</em>. It can show you why your best relationships feel like alliances and where romance is most likely to find you. It cannot tell you who is "the one," because no house can - that question belongs to your life, not your chart.</p>

