<p><strong>Why ease can stall depth:</strong> Depth usually comes from being stretched, witnessed in difficulty, and relied on under pressure. A chart with almost no friction gives a couple little to work through together, so the bond can stay pleasant and shallow — not because anyone failed, but because nothing ever asked it to go further.</p>
